UID:99939cb4b093e7c2f41cba78@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260822T190312Z
SUMMARY:YOGA AMONG THE PINES
LOCATION:St. Patrick's County Parks | 50651 Laurel Road | South Bend\, IN 4
 6637
DESCRIPTION:Renew yourself amidst the shade of the pine trees as you enjoy 
 yoga in the refreshing outdoors. Each session is geared towards ages 16+.
  Please bring your own mat\, water\, and towel. In case of rain or lightn
 ing\, we will meet under the Pfeil Pavilion or in the White Barn Harvest 
 Room. Registration and payment required by Thursday\, August 20.\n\nMore 
 Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/yoga-among-the-pines-2/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/yoga-among-the-pines-2/
